<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">2Qoronttoosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawulosa Qoronttoosa Asayis Xaafeez Nam77intha Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Qoronttoosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Qor.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa Asayis Xaafeez Nam7intho Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa asayis xaafeez nam7intho kiitay xaafintteezay, ees Qoronttoosa woosa keethara yez zatay iita meto gancce gelii yez wode. Pettii pettii woosa keeth asitay Phawuloosana iita boro borikokka Phawuloosa dabbotith medhdhodayis ees amo yezana beeziza. Yeyi hanodar dama ufayss ufayttodayis danda7izaya beeziza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa fa kiitay tiina kifilayid, Qoronttoosa woosa keethara ees yez pettipettith beezii, woosa keetha medhintteez borosinnee ixos abis mino mahith inggeezako odiza. Yeyira helthii e seeray unttan nagarapp mahii dabothos heltheez gishos E ufaytteez ufassana unttis beeziza. Kaallikka, Yihuda yez ammaniza asay maaddodayis paas yeza bazapp cere inggoday garkk hassaysiza. Wurssith shemppitayid Phawuloosa fa hawaaretithayil afa denddeez mootayis mahith inggiza. Yeykka, Qoronttoosa woosa keetha yez pettii pettii asitay fana, «Tuma hawaare» udii, «Phawuloosana worddo hawaare» udii mootiza.</para>
  <para style="iot">2 Qoronttoosa kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosannee Qoronttoosa woosa keetha <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 1:12-7:16">1:12—7:16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yihuda yez ammaniza asay tam7e <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 8:1-9:15">8:1—9:15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa fa hawaaretithis inggeez mahith <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 10:1-13:10">10:1—13:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kustte qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 13:11-14">13:11-14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1"/>Xooss shener Yesuus Kiristtoosa hawaare maaqqeez Phawuloosannee, nu isha Ximaatoosa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Qoronttoosa yez Xooss woosa keethisinnee Akkaya biitta yez Xooss asayir pettipp Xooss as maaqqeezitayis xaafeez kiita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:1">Haw. O. 18:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2"/>Xooss nu Adayppennee Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosapp, aadho keehatethinnee sarotithii yinttis maaqqo.<verse eid="2CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Xoossa galatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3"/>Maarotith Adayis, ubba wode nuna minthathiza Xoossayis, nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa Adayis galata maaqqo. <verse eid="2CO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4"/>Xoossay nuus inggeez minthathor, metor yezita nu minthathoday garkk Xoossay nuna nu meto ubbayid minthathiza. <verse eid="2CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5"/>Kiristtoosa gaame waayay nuul gaangeezay garkk ma kiristtoosa baggar E minthathay gaanggoda. <verse eid="2CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6"/>Nuunii waayinttiko yeyi yinttan minthathodayisnnee yinttan ashshodayisii. Ma nuunii minggiko nuunii waayayid garzheezay garkk yinttikka garzhii, Xoossay yinttis inggiza minthathor minggoda. <verse eid="2CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7"/>Yi nu ekkeez metay garkk ekkii, nu minthatha shaakinttodana nu eriza gishos nu yinttal gaddeez ufayssay mino.<verse eid="2CO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8"/>Nu ishuntho, Iisa biitta nuna helleez meta yi eroday garkk nu koyiza. Ye nuna helleez metay nu wolqqaypp aadhin, shemppor attodibazikka nuus erinttekkazin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:32">1 Qor. 15:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9"/>Nuunii nuul afa yhayiqo pirdda pirddintteezay garkk qoppeeza. Zini nuunii nu ommas baazin, yhayqqeezita denthiza Xoossayil ammaninttoday garkk yeyi haneeza. <verse eid="2CO 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10"/>Xoossay yey garkk iita yhayiqopp nuna ashsheeza; yhattekka ashshiza; tiinepekka E nuna ashshoda gi ezal ufayss gaddiza. <verse eid="2CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11"/>Woosar nuna maaddoytta. Gaame asay woosapp denddeezayid Xooss imota nu denggiza wode gaame asay nu gishos Xoossa galattiza.<verse eid="2CO 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa fa qofa laammo bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12"/>Nu ceeqay yhaya. Nuunii yha alamel yezeez yessayid ubbarakka yinttar yezeez yessayid Xoossapp maaqqeez xilotitharannee luuletithar yinttar yezeezana nu kahay markkatiza. Yeykka, yha alame ecetithar baazin Xooss aadho keehatithay garkke. <verse eid="2CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13"/>Nu yinttis xaafeez dabddaabbe yi nabbabodayisinnee akaakodayis danda7oowa bazi nu yinttis xaafaamii. Yi eza akaakodayis danda7izaya ta ammaniza. <verse eid="2CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14"/>Yhatti yi nuna wursii erooya, zin tiinapp wurssii erodaya ta ammaninttiza. Nu Goda Yesuusa maaqqiza wode nu yinttal ceeqinttizay garkk yinttikka nuul ceeqinttoda.<verse eid="2CO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15"/>Yeya taanii loyth ereez gishos yi nam7intho maadinttoday garkk yinttiko yhanigodayis qofa acceeza. <verse eid="2CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16"/>Taanii Maqadoona yhanigitarannee ezaypp maaqqittar yinttan be7ada. Taanii ezaypp Yihuda yhanigodar yi tana ta ogayid maaddoda gi qoppeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Haw. O. 19:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17"/>Taanii yeya giittar ab oothodayis beezizako erekka as aazinee? Woy taanii ta qofa acciz wode as qofa garkk, pettii toke «Ee» ma pettii toke «wa77a» giz as garkkennee?<verse eid="2CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18"/>Zini Xoossay ammanintteeza maaqqeez gishos nu yinttis odiza qaalay «Ee» woy «wa77a» giza walkka baaya. <verse eid="2CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19"/>Taara, Sillaaserannee Ximaatoosar yinttis markkatteez Xooss Na7ay, Yesuus Kiristtoosa ubba wode «Eepp» attin «Ee» nnee «wa77a» baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Haw. O. 18:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20"/>Xoossay inggod geez ubbay Kiristtoosa baggar «Ee» maaqqiza. Nuunii Kiristtoosa baggar Xooss bonchchos, «Amin77ee» gizay yey gishosii. <verse eid="2CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21"/>Nuurannee yinttara Kiristtoosar miinggii eqqoday garkk udeezaynnee fa oosayis dooreezay Xoosse. <verse eid="2CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22"/>Nuunii ebaz maaqqeezana erisodayis fa maatama nuul afa gaddeeza; ma fa Geeshsha Ayyana saathi udii nu wozina gaddeeza.<verse eid="2CO 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23"/>Taanii Qoronttoosa yhanigekka atteezay yi azanaamay garkkesii; yeyi worddo maaqqiko Xoossii taas markka. <verse eid="2CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24"/>Yi, yi ammanayid miinggii yez gishos nu yinttan ufayssodayis yinttar wolla oothizitaypp attin yinttan yi ammanayil wolqqanthooya.<verse eid="2CO 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1"/>Taanii maaqqii yinttiko ye7aam gi qofa acceezay yinttan azanthaamayis. <verse eid="2CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2"/>Taanii yinttan azanthikokka ta azantheez yinttipp hara tana ufayssodayis yezay oonoo? <verse eid="2CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3"/>Taanii yinttis ye dabddaabba xaafeezay, ta yinttan be7adayis yhanigodar tana ufayssodayis beeziza asayir ta azanodayis koyowa gishosii. Ta ufayssay yi ubbay ufayss maaqqizana ta ammaniza. <verse eid="2CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4"/>Taanii gaame waayerannee un77ar ma gaame aafuthar xaafeezay, yinttan azanthodayis baazin taanii yinttan ubba waafa garkk dosizako yinttan erisodayisii.<verse eid="2CO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qoheezana maarobagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5"/>Ase azantheez oonkka yeziko ta e buuta suqqith maaqqipepp attin tana baazin yinttipp gaamita azantheeza. <verse eid="2CO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6"/>Yinttipp gaame asay ye atha seereez seeray ees gidoda. <verse eid="2CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7"/>Yeyi gishos, ye athay iita azanii, ufayss gachchaamay garkk yi eza maarodayisinnee minthathodayis beeziza. <verse eid="2CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8"/>Yi eza siiqizana mahii eza beezoday garkk ta yinttan woosiza. <verse eid="2CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9"/>Ta ye dabidaabba yinttis xaafeezay, yi paacintti, ubba bazar taas kiitinttiza erodayis koyeez gishosii. <verse eid="2CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10"/>Yi maariza as taakka maaroda. Taanii maarodibaz abii yezakokka, Kiristtoosa tiina yi gishos gi maareeza. <verse eid="2CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11"/>Taanii yeya ootheezay Xalahe doosha oosa nu eriza gishos xalaher dooshinttaamay garkkesii.<verse eid="2CO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xiro7aada Phawuloosa un77intto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12"/>Taanii Kiristtoosa Wonggile sabbakodayis Xiro7aada yhanigeez wode Goday ezayid taas ooso penge dooyii gaddeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:1">Haw. O. 20:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13"/>Zini taanii ta isha Tito ezayid denggekka gishos ta wozinay shemppekkaya. Yeyi gishos, ezayid yez asa sarothii eza koyodayis Maqadoona yhanigeeza.<verse eid="2CO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14"/>Zini Kiristtoosa baggar ubba wode nuna gamizita udii kaalithizaynnee shitto garkk tonkk gi sawuza Kiristtoosa bagga nu eriza eratitha ubba aqo helthoday garkk udeeza Xoossa galata hello. <verse eid="2CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15"/>Nuunii attod asayisinnee dhabod asay gancce Kiristtoosa baggar Xoossis inggintteez sawuza shittogarkke. <verse eid="2CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16"/>Dhabod asayis yhayqqok kanggiz yhayiqo sawo; ma attiz asayis de7oko kanggiza de7o sawo; yeezin, yey garkk oosayis maaqqaday oonoo? <verse eid="2CO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17"/>Nuunii Xooss qaala wodhe denggodayis koyii walakkii zal7iz gaame asaygarkk baaya. Zini Xoossay kiitteez luule asitay garkk Kiristtoosar yezii Xooss tiina qaala ododa.<verse eid="2CO 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Oorath caaqo oosanchchita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1"/>Nuunii mahii nuna sabo aykkodennee? Woy hara as garkk, galata dabddaabbe yinttis dakkodayis woy yinttapp ekkodayis nuna koshshinee? <verse eid="2CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2"/>Asii ubbay yinttan erod garkkennee nabbaboday garkk yi nu wozinayid xaafinttii yez nu dabddaabbe. <verse eid="2CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3"/>Yi qalamer baazin Xooss Ayyanar, shuchchal afa baazin as wozina xaafintteezitannee nu oosor bentteez Kiristtoosa dabddaabbe maaqqeezana beezeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:12">Kes. 24:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">Erim. 31:33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:19">Iziqe. 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:26">36:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4"/>Nu yeya geezay, Kiristtoosa baggar Xoossal ammano nuus yeza gishosii. <verse eid="2CO 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5"/>Nu yeya oothodayis danda7eezay Xooss wolqqarapp attin nuunii nu wolqqar akkokka udodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="2CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6"/>Nu oroth caaqo oosanchchita maaqqoday garkk Xoossay nuna udeeza. Ye oroth caaqay Geeshsha Ayyanar bentteezaypp attin xaafintteez higger baaya. Higge wodhiza, zin Geeshsha Ayyanay de7o inggiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Erim. 31:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7"/>Shuchchal afa xaafintteez higge ingginttiza wode Xooss bonchcho bentteeza. Muse sinayil yez bonchchay dhabittar yhanigizabaz maaqqikokka, Isreele asay e sina dhoqqi gi be7adayis danda7ekkaya. Yikkee, yhayiqo ki7iz higge yey garkk bonchchor benttiko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:29">Kes. 34:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8"/>yeezin, Geeshsha Ayyanar oosintteez oosay bonchchay wayizii aadhii benttodee? <verse eid="2CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9"/>Asal afa pirdda ki7iz higge bonchcho maaqqiko yeezin, as xillisiza oroth ogay wayizii aadhii bonchchinttoosa? <verse eid="2CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10"/>Guye bonchchay ubbapp aath maaqqeezaypp denddeezayid tiina bonchchay akkokka baazay garkk payidintteeza. <verse eid="2CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11"/>Xiqqa wodes benttii guyeppe dhabeezay yey garkk bonchchinttiko, medhinas yezay wayizii aadho bonchchinttoosa?<verse eid="2CO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12"/>Nuus yhay garkk ufayssay yeza gishos yeellatekka odinttoda. <verse eid="2CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13"/>Muse dhabittar yhanigiz e sino pocithay deskemod hellodayis Isra7elitay be7aamay garkk fa aafa gooziza. Nuna maaqqiko e garkk baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:33">Kes. 34:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14"/>Zini u wozinay docceeza. Yhayino hellodayis cima caaqa nabbabodar u wozinay ye kamayir kamit yeza. Ye kamay Kiristtoosa aaddar hali7iza. <verse eid="2CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15"/>Zini yhayino hellodayiskka Muse maxaafa nabbabodar ubbayid ye kamay u wozinayil kammitii yeza. <verse eid="2CO 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16"/>Zini oonkka Godayiko maaqqeez wode ayidekka ye kamay hali7iza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:34">Kes. 34:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17"/>Goday Ayyana; Goda Ayyanay yez aqo wallotithii yeza. <verse eid="2CO 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18"/>Nuunii ubbay kaminttekka sino masttooter bi7izay garkk Goday bonchcha be7ada. Nuunii Ayyana maaqqeez Goday mala aazodayis bonchchopp bonchchoko laaminttoda.<verse eid="2CO 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Tuma hawaaretith ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1"/>Yikkee, Xoossay fa maarotethar yha oosa nuus inggeez gishos nuunii ufayss gachchaamii. <verse eid="2CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2"/>Nuunii yeellathiza geema ooso ubba ashshii; gene ooso oothaamii; Xooss qaala worddor walakkaamii. Tuma qonccer nashshittar, as ubbay kahay nuna ekkoday garkk Xooss tiina nuna shiishoda.<verse eid="2CO 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3"/>Nu odiza Wonggilay kamintteez baz maaqqikokka, kamintteezay dhabo ogel yez asayisii. <verse eid="2CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4"/>Yha alama haariza Xoossay ammanoowa asay wozina goozeeza. Unttii Xooss aazii bentteez Kiristtoosa bonchcho Wonggile poo7a be7aamay garkk kayeeza. <verse eid="2CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5"/>Nuunii, Yesuus Kiristtoosa Goda maaqqeezannee nu e gishos yi ayilita maaqqeezana odinepp attin nubaz baaya. <verse eid="2CO 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6"/>«Poo7o dhuma gancce poo7o» geez Xoossay, Kiristtoosa tiina poo7iza Xooss bonchcho eratith poo7a inggodayis fa poo7a nu wozinayid poo7ooday garkk udeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Medhe. 1:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7"/>Zini ubbaypp aadhiz wolqqay nuupp baazin Xoossapp maaqqeezana beeziza yha bonchcho miishay biittapp medhintteezita maaqqeez nu gancce yeza.<verse eid="2CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8"/>Nu ubba baggar urqqinttiza zin gaminttaamii. Nuus haddirss maaqqeeza, zin ufayss gachchaamii. <verse eid="2CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9"/>Nu bayi7inttiza, zin doginttaamii. Nu pokkiza, zin dhabaamii. <verse eid="2CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10"/>Yesuusa de7ay nu asetithayid benttoday garkk e yhayiqa ubba wode nu asetithayid tookkii yuuyiza. <verse eid="2CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11"/>Yesuusa de7ay yhayqqiz nu asetithayid benttoday garkk path yez nuunii e gishos ubba wode yhayiqos aadhii ingginttoda. <verse eid="2CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12"/>Yikkee, yhayiqo nuul oothiza, zini de7o yinttal oothiza.<verse eid="2CO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Ta ammaneeza; yey gishos odeeza» yeegintteeza. Yey garkkekka pettii ammano ayyana nuus yeza gishos nu ammaniza yeyi gishos odeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Maz. 116:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14"/>Goda Yesuusana yhayiqopp dentheez Xoossay, nunakka Yesuusar denthodannee yinttar wolla shiishodana ta eriza. <verse eid="2CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15"/>Yeyi ubbay haneezay yi gishos. Pucceez aadho keehatithay gaame asa heleezay garkk asay Xooss bonchchos maaqqiz galata gaanggoday garkke.<verse eid="2CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanor yess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16"/>Yeyi gishos, nuunii ufayss gachchaamii. Benttiz nu asetithay daaburittar yhanigizabaz maaqqikokka, nu ayyana asetithay gallas gallas ooroxiza. <verse eid="2CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17"/>Yhattes nuunii waayinttiza yha kawushsha waayay, ubbapp loytho aadhiz medhina bonchcha nuus inggisoda. <verse eid="2CO 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18"/>Nuunii benttizibaz baazin benttowabaza bi7iza. Benttizibazay yhattes, zin benttowabazay medhinasii.<verse eid="2CO 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1"/>Yhatti nu yez dunkkaane aaziz yha sa7a asetithay laalinttikokka, as keexxekka, Xoossii keexxeez medhina karay nuus salo yezana eriza. <verse eid="2CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2"/>Salo asetitha ma77odayis amottittar yhatti yha sa7a yessar butinttiza. <verse eid="2CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3"/>Nuunii yeya ma77eez wode kallottaamii. <verse eid="2CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4"/>Dunkkaane aaziz yha sa7a asetithayid nu yezar deexin shemittiza. Yhayqqiz nu asetithay de7o laaminttoday garkk salo asetitha ma77odayis koyinepp attin kallotodayis baaya. <verse eid="2CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5"/>Nuna yhayis giigiseezay Xoosse. Ezikka saathi udii fa Ayyana nuus inggeeza.<verse eid="2CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6"/>Yeyi gishos, nuunii yha sa7a asetithar yez wode ubbayid Godaypp haakkii yezana erikokka ubba wode ammaninttii yeza. <verse eid="2CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7"/>Nuunii yezizay Goda ammanorapp attin eza bi7ithar baaya. <verse eid="2CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8"/>Nu yha sa7a asetithapp shaakinttii, nu kara yhanigii Godayir pettipp yezodayis amottiz gishos ammaninttii yeza. <verse eid="2CO 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9"/>Yeyi gishos, nu yha asetithayir yezin woy yha asetithayipp shaakinttin, nu amay eza ufayssodaya. <verse eid="2CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10"/>Nuunii pettay pettay yha sa7a yessar lo77o maaqqin iita maaqqin, ootheez oosayis beeziza pirdda ekkodayis Kiristtoosa pirdda zufaanayi tiina shiiqodayis beeziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:10">Oro. 14:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ase Xoossar dabotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11"/>Yikkee, nuunii Goda yashitithii ab guussizako eriza gishos asay nu odiza ekkoday garkk zoroda. Xoossay, nuunii oonazako nuna eriza; ma yinttikka yi kahayid nu oonazako eriza gi nu qoppiza. <verse eid="2CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12"/>Wozina gancce yez bazar baazin malar ceeqinttiza asa doona aythodayis yi nuur ceeqinttoday garkk yinttis oge maaqqodayis koyinepp attin nu nuna mahii nashshodayis koyooya. <verse eid="2CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13"/>Nu eeyita maaqqiko Xooss bonchchosii; kahaamita maaqqiko yi gishosii. <verse eid="2CO 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14"/>Pettay ubbayis yhayqqeezannee ubbay ma e yhayiqa shakintteezana nu eriza gishos Kiristtoosa siiqqay nuna haariza. <verse eid="2CO 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15"/>De7or yezitay yikkepp guye paas baazin unttis yhayqqeezayisinnee yhayiqopp denddeezayis yezoday garkk Kiristtoosa as ubbay gishos yhayqqeeza.<verse eid="2CO 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16"/>Yikkepp guye, nuunii oonakka asho aafer be7aamii. Yhaypp tiina nuunii Kiristtoosanakka asho aafer be7eezi baz maaqqikokka, yikkepp yhay garkk be7aamii. <verse eid="2CO 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17"/>Yeyi gishos, oonkka Kiristtoosar yeziko oroth medhetithii; cima medhetithay aadheeza; ubbaykka oorath maaqqeeza. <verse eid="2CO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18"/>Yeya ubba Xoossay ootheeza. E Kiristtoosa baggar nuna paar dabotheeza. Ma yhankkita paar dabothoday garkk nuus dabotho ooso inggeeza. <verse eid="2CO 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19"/>Xoossay Kiristtoosa baggar as ubba paar dabothiza. U nagara payidooya; ma asa paar iginthiza qaala nuus inggeeza.<verse eid="2CO 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20"/>Xoossay asa nu baggar xeegiz gishos nu Kiristtoosas kiitinttizitay asa Xoossar igintto gi Kiristtoosa gishos woossiza. <verse eid="2CO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21"/>Nuunii Xooss xillotith Kiristtoosa baggar ekkoday garkk, nagara eroowa Kiristtoosa nu gishos nagaranchcho as garkk maaqqeeza.<verse eid="2CO 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1"/>Nuunii Xoossar wolla oothiza as maaqqeezay garkk, yi ekkeez aadho keehatitha cere mahaamay garkk nu yinttan woossiza. <verse eid="2CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2"/>Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">«Ta nena si7od wode si7eeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">atotith gallas nena maaddeeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">yeegiza. Yeezako, ta si7od woday yhatte; atotith gallasaykka yhayino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Isa. 49:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3"/>Oonkka nu oosa boraamay garkkennee nuur dhubinttoday garkk koyooya. <verse eid="2CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4"/>Hano zin, nu tuma Xooss oosanchchita maaqqeezana nu oothiza ubba bazar beezeeza. Gaame garzhor, waayer, metor, un77ar, <verse eid="2CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5"/>garafinttithar, achchar, cabbotithar, oothor daaburar, gentta dhabor, xoomar,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Haw. O. 16:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6"/>geeshshetithar, eratithar, danda7ar, keehatithar, Geeshsha Ayyanar, tuma siiqor, <verse eid="2CO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7"/>tuma odarannee Xooss wolqqar nuunii e oosanchchita maaqqeezana beezeeza. Ma xillotithay nuus toorannee gonddalle. <verse eid="2CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8"/>Nuunii bonchchinttodayisi tooshinttodayisi; cazhinttodayisinnee galatinttodayisii giigintteeza. Tuma nashsheezita, zin asay nuna worddotizita geeza. <verse eid="2CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9"/>Nu erinttoowa as aazittar erintteezita maaqqeeza. Yhayqqeezita yeegintteezita, zin paxa yeza; shocintteeza, zin yhayqqekkaya. <verse eid="2CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10"/>Nuunii azanikokka ubba wode ufayttiza. Nuunnii manqqo aaziza, zin gaame asa duriseeza. Ma akkokka baa as aazeeza, zin ubbay nubaz.<verse eid="2CO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11"/>Yntino Qoronttoosa asayyo, nu yinttis geeshshii odeeza; nu ula yinttan wursii beezeeza. <verse eid="2CO 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12"/>Yi nuna yi siiqo beezoowa kayenepp attin nu nu siiqo yinttan kayekkaya. <verse eid="2CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13"/>Ade fa na7itayis odizay garkk ta yinttis odiza; nu yinttan nu ula beezeezay garkk, yinttikka yi ula nuna beezoytta.<verse eid="2CO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanoowa asayir yez pettipettitha asho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14"/>Ammanoowa asayir beezoowa oger waaxinttipate. Xillotithinnee nagara ab woli helthee? Poo7osinnee dhumas aba pettipettithii yenee? <verse eid="2CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15"/>Kiristtoosannee Xalahe woli helithiza baz abba? Ma ammanizayinnee ammanowazay pettipp koxizabaz abba? <verse eid="2CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16"/>Xooss Keethayis eeqitayir aba pettipettithii yenee? Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">«Taanii u gancce yessada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">u ganccer yedhdhoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Taanii u Xooss maaqqoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">unttikka ta woya maaqqada»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:16">geezay garkk, nuunii de7o Xooss keethe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lewii. 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Iziqe. 37:27</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Qor. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:19">6:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17"/>Yey garkkekka, Goday,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">«Unttii ganccepp shaakinttii kezoytta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">tuna maaqqeez baz bochchipatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">ta yinttan ekkoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Isa. 52:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18"/>Ta yinttis ade maaqqada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">yi taas diirithi na7itannee maachch na7ita maaqqada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">Yeegiza Ubbapp Wolqqama Goday» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam. 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Zeena. 17:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:6">Isa. 43:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:9">Erim. 31:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1"/>Yikkee, ta dabbitayo, yha ufayssay nuus yez gishos nu ashannee nu shemppo tunisiza baz ubbaypp nuna naagoda. Xoossayis yashshitti nu geeshshatitha wola folo udoda.<verse eid="2CO 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa ufayssa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2"/>Yi wozinapp nuna ekkoytta. Nuunii oonakka naaqqekkaya; oonakka qohekkaya; oonakka dooshshekkaya. <verse eid="2CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3"/>Taanii yeya yinttal afa pirddodayis gooya. Yhaypp tiina ta yinttis odeezay garkk, yi nu wozinayid yeza; nu paxa yezinkka yhayqqinkka yinttipp shaakinttaamii. <verse eid="2CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4"/>Yinttal afa yez ta ammanay damma; ta yinttal afa ceeqinttizay damma; nu waaye ubbayid nu ufayttiza; ma minthathinttiza.<verse eid="2CO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5"/>Nuunii Maqadoona yhanigeez wode gaame oger waayintteezapp attin aba shemppokka denggekkaya. Balera morkker, ganccera yashshar un77intteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:13">2 Zeena. 2:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6"/>Zini azzaneezita minthathiza Xoossay, Tito yi7ithayir nuna minthatheeza. <verse eid="2CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7"/>Nuna minthatheezay Tito yi7ithayid aadda baazin yinttikka eza minthatheeza. Yi tana laamoteezaya, taas azzanizannee taas qoppizana ta si7eez wode tana usa ufaysseeza.<verse eid="2CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8"/>Ta xaapeez kiitay yinttan azzanthikokka abis xaafeeneshsha gi qiiradhdhaamii. Ta qiiradheezay ta xaafeez kiitay yinttan xiqqa wodes azzantheez gishosi. <verse eid="2CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9"/>Yhatti taanii ufaytteezay, ta yinttan azzantheez gishos baazin yi azzanay yinttan yi nagaraypp maheez gishosi. Xoossay fa shene garkk yinttan azzantheenepp attin nu yinttan abarakka qohekkaya. <verse eid="2CO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10"/>Xooss shene maaqqeez azanay, atotithiko helthiza nagarapp maaqqithiko ki7iza; yeykka qiirisooya. Zini yha sa7a azanay yhayiqo ki7iza. <verse eid="2CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11"/>Yhay Xooss shene garkk maaqqeez azzanay ab garkk denthitho, ab garkk mahithi, ab garkk kachchii, ab garkk yashsha, ab garkk laamoth, ab garkk qinate, ab garkk kushe keso yi gancce ke7eezako lo7ithii bo7oytta. Yha ubba bazar yi geeshshi maaqqeezana markkaseeza.<verse eid="2CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12"/>Yeyi gishos, taanii yha dabddaabba yinttis xaafeezay, qoheez atha woy qohintteez athay gishos baaya. Zini yi nuus ab garkk qoppeezako Xooss tiina yi, yinttan be7aday garkk xaafeeza. <verse eid="2CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13"/>Nuunii ufaytteezay yey gishosii. Nu ufayssaypp aadhii nuna loyth ufaysseezay, yi Tito ufaysseezayidannee e wozina shemppiseezayida. <verse eid="2CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14"/>Taanii yinttan nashshichchii ees odin yi tana yeellasekkaya. Zini nuunii ubba wode yinttis turo odeeza; yay garkk nuunii Tito tiina yinttan nashsheezay tuma maaqqeeza. <verse eid="2CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15"/>Yi ees yashshar kukkurii, eza mokkeezanee ma ees ab garkk kiitintteezako E qoppii e yinttis yez siiqqay minggittar qiteeza. <verse eid="2CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16"/>Taanii ubba bazar yinttan ammaninttiza gishos ufayttiza.<verse eid="2CO 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Ufayssar imobagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1"/>Nu ishuntho, Xoossay Maqadoona yez woosa keethitayis inggeez aadho keehatitha yi eroday garkk nu koyiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:26">Oro. 15:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2"/>Unttii iita metor paacintteeza, zin u ufayssay wolqqama. U manqqotithayis zawa baaya, zin u fa imo duretitha gaantheeza. <verse eid="2CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3"/>Unttii fa wolqqay garkkennee fa wolqqaypp aath qadhdhii inggeezayis ta markka. <verse eid="2CO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4"/>Unttii Xooss asay maaddiza lo77o ooso nuura oothodayis koyii nuna miinthii woosseeza. <verse eid="2CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5"/>Unttii nu qoppeezaypp aathii ootheeza. Tiinatii Xooss shene garkk u fana Godayis inggeeza; ma yeypp, fana nuuskka inggeeza.<verse eid="2CO 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6"/>Yha lo77o oosa tiinatii aykkeezay Tito maaqqeez gishos yhattekka ye oothodayid yinttan maaddii, ye oosa polisoday garkk eza nu woosseeza. <verse eid="2CO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7"/>Zini yi ubba bazar, ammanor, odar, eretithar, azaalla bayith, nuna siiqorannee ubba bazar yi aadhizay garkk yha lo77o oosayidakka yi keeha maaqqoday garkk nu koyiza.<verse eid="2CO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8"/>Taanii yeya yinttan azazodayis gooya. Zini yhankkitay azala bayth inggizana yi siiqayir helthii bi7ii yi ab garkk tumazako erodayis ta giza. <verse eid="2CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9"/>Yi nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehetitha eriza. Kiristtoosa durezar, yi e manqqotithayir duritoday garkk yi gishos manqqeeza.<verse eid="2CO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10"/>Taanii yha odayid yinttan maaddiza zore zorodayis koyiza. Yi ziqinebere inggodayis aadda baazin yeya oothodayis yi tiina amotteeza. <verse eid="2CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11"/>Yi oothodayis aykkeez oosa yhatti poloytta. Yi yinttis yezay garkk inggiko, yeyi yi inggodayis gaame amottizana beeziza. <verse eid="2CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12"/>Pettii as inggodayis amottiko, e imay Xooss tiina ekinttizay, E paas yezay garkk inggikopp attin baazayipp inggodayis un77inttin baaya.<verse eid="2CO 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13"/>Taanii yeya gizay, yi ubbay pettii qara maaqqoday garkkepp attin yhankkitay gaame waayaypp shemppin yi waayinttoday garkkes baaya. <verse eid="2CO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14"/>Yi metintteez Wode u pucay yi paca kunthoday garkk yhatti yi pucay u paca kuntho. Ezayid yi pettii qara maaqqoda. <verse eid="2CO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Gaame shiisheezayis pucekkaya; xiqqa shiisheezayiskka paccekkaya» ginttinttii xaafintteezay garkk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Kes. 16:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Titonnee e zhamita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16"/>Nu yinttis qoppizay garkk Titokka yinttis qoppod garkk ootheez Xoossay galatintto. <verse eid="2CO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17"/>Tito yinttiko yhanigeezay, nu eza denthitheez gishos baazin E fa shener yhanigodayis amotteez gishosi. <verse eid="2CO 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18"/>Wonggile markkatithar woosa keeth ubbayid loythii erintteez isha, nuunii Titora pettipp kiittoda. <verse eid="2CO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19"/>Yeyil afa nuunii yha keeha ima kanggodar e nuura yhammaday garkk yha lo77o oosayid Goda bonchchodayisinnee yhankkita maaddodayis yez ama beezodayis woosa keetha e doorintteeza.<verse eid="2CO 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20"/>Yha inggintteez keeha ima, nu oosol afa peeshshiz wode borinttaamay garkk naaginttoda. <verse eid="2CO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21"/>Nuunii Goday tiina aadda baazin as tiinakka lo77o maaqqeez baz oothoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:4">Aazi. 3:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22"/>Ma gaame wode faacinttii mino maaqqii bentteez nu isha, unttara yinttiko azazeeza. E yinttal lo7ithii ammaninttiza gishos yhatti yinttan maaddodayis gaame amottiza. <verse eid="2CO 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23"/>Tito bagga erodayis koyko, E yinttan maaddodayis taara oothiz ta ooso zhame. Yhankko ishitayi bagga maaqqiko woosa keethitay kiitteezita; ma asay u yessa bi7ii Kiristtoosana bonchchiza. <verse eid="2CO 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24"/>Yeyi gishos, woosa keethitay yi siiqannee nu yinttan nashshizay tuma maaqqeezana qonccisodayis yi siiqo yha asita beezoytta.<verse eid="2CO 8:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Ammaniza asayis kesseez miishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1"/>Ammaniza asayis kessiza miishiyabagga ta yinttis xaafodayis koshshooya. <verse eid="2CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2"/>Yi maaddodayis loyth amottizana ta eriza. Yi Akkaya asay, ziqineberepp aykkii maaddodayis giigintteezana taanii Maqadoona asayis doona kunthi odeeza. Yi gita amaykka unttapp gaamita denthitheeza. <verse eid="2CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3"/>Yha oosayid Yinttal nu ceeqinttiza ceeqay cere maaqqaamay garkk tiina yi bagga ta odeezay garkk yi giiginttii naagoday garkk yha ishita yinttiko kiiteeza. <verse eid="2CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4"/>Maqadoona asay taara yi7ii, yi giiginttekkazin, denggiko, nu yinttal yeellatoda; ma yi nuupp aadho yeellatoda. <verse eid="2CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5"/>Yeyi gishos, yha ishitay taapp tiinatii yinttiko yhanigii, yi inggodi geez imo tiinatii giigisod garkk ta unttan kiiteeza. Taanii hellodar ya imay giigii bettiza. Ye wode ye keehatithar imay wolqqar baazin dosor maaqqeezana erisiza.<verse eid="2CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6"/>Xiqqa zereezay xiqqa shiishoda; gaame zereezay gaame buucoda yeegizaya akaakoytta. <verse eid="2CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7"/>Xooss ufayisar inggiza atha dosiza gishos wolqqar woy mor7er baazin pettii pettii as fa wozinayir qoppeezay garkk dosor inggodayis beeziza. <verse eid="2CO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8"/>Ubba wode ubba bazar yinttan danda7i lo77o ooso ubbayis peeshshodayis yinttis gidoda garkk Xoossay yinttis fa anjjo gaanthoda. <verse eid="2CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">«E fa shala manqqitayis laaleeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">e xillotithay medhinas yeziza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 9:9">yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Maz. 112:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10"/>Zerizayis zerethi, maadayis katha inggiza Goday, yi zeriz zeritha gaanthii inggoda. Yi xillotith aafakka gaanthoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:10">Isa. 55:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11"/>Gaame asay yi inggiza ima nuupp ekkii, Xooss galatoday garkk, yi ubba wode gaanthii inggizita maaqqoday garkk Xoossay yinttan ubba baggar durisoda. <verse eid="2CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12"/>Yha yi inggiza imay ammaniza asay pace kuntho aadda baazin asay Xoossa galatiza oge maaqqiza. <verse eid="2CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13"/>Yha yi oosay yi ammana erisii Kiristtoosa Wonggile yi ammaneezannee ees kiitinttii yinttis yeza baz unttarannee yhankkitayir shaakintteez gishos ubbay Xooss bonchchoda. <verse eid="2CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14"/>Xoossay yinttis inggeez aadho keehatithay gishos u yinttis Xoossa woossittar yinttan be7adayis laamotiza. <verse eid="2CO 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15"/>Zawa baa Xooss imayis Xoossay galatintto.<verse eid="2CO 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa mootizitayis maheez mahith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1"/>Ta yinttar yeza wode haayo, ma yinttipp haakkin nuul afa miinggiza yeegintteez, Phawuloosa, keehannee ashikke maaqqeez Kiristtoosa sunthar yinttan woosiza. <verse eid="2CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2"/>Taanii yinttiko yhanigodar nuna asho qofar yuuyiza as udii qoppiza asayil afa mino qaalar odinttodayis qopeeza. Yinttal afa yey garkk odinttoday garkk yi tana oothaamay garkk yinttan woosiza. <verse eid="2CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3"/>Nuunii yha sa7all yezikoka yha sa7a as garkk olinttaam. <verse eid="2CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4"/>Nu ola miishay yha sa7asa baaya. Zini mishshige laalodayis wolqqar yez Xooss toora. <verse eid="2CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5"/>Xooss eratithal afa dhube maaqqii denddizi palamannee utira qofa ubba laalloda. As qofa ubba di77i Kiristtoosas azazinttoday garkk oothoda. <verse eid="2CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6"/>Yi kiitinttay folo maaqqeez wode nuunii kiitintto ixo ubba seerodayis giigintteeza.<verse eid="2CO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7"/>Yi bi7izay asho aafayir benttizaya. Oonkka fana Kiristtoosa bagga gi ammaninttii qoppizabaz maaqqiko, nuukka Kiristtoosa bagga maaqqeezana ero. <verse eid="2CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8"/>Goday taas inggeez mawuter ceeqinttikokka yeyid yeellataam. Ye mawutay taas inggintteezay yinttan dichchodayisapp attin qohodayis baaya. <verse eid="2CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9"/>Taanii ta xaafeez kiititayid yinttan yashishodayis koyii xaafeez baz yinttis aazippe. <verse eid="2CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10"/>Pettii pettii asay, «Phawuloosa xaafeez kiitay deexonnee wolqqama, zin eza bi7iza wode E daaburanchcha; e odaykka pathoowa baz» yeegiz aaziza. <verse eid="2CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11"/>Ye asitay nu haakko yezar xaafiza dabddaabbiyarannee ukke yinttar yezar oothiza oosay gancce dummatithii baazana akaako.<verse eid="2CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12"/>Nuunii fana sabiza asitayir nuna payidodayis woy qarasodayis koyooya. Zini unttii fana paar helithii woy qaras bi7ittar yezayir unttis akaakeeza aazippe.<verse eid="2CO 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13"/>Zini nuunii Xoossay nuus inggeez dhassayid ceeqinttinepp attin zawa aadhii ceeqinttooya; ye zaway yinttikokka heliza. <verse eid="2CO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14"/>Nuunii beezizaypp aathii ceeqinttooya, zin Kiristtoosa Wonggile yinttiko heltheezayid ceeqinttoda. <verse eid="2CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15"/>Nuunii Xoossay esseez zawa piinggii, yhankkitay ootheez oosor ceeqinttaamii. Hano zin, yi ammanay diccoday garkk Xoossay inggeez zawayid yi gancce nu oothiza oosay dalggoda gi qoppiza. <verse eid="2CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16"/>Nuunii hara as fa zawayil ootheez oosol gelii ceeqinttekkar yinttipp piinggii haras Wonggile markkattodayis danda7iza. <verse eid="2CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17"/>Zini, Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Ceeqqiza ubbay Godayil ceeqqo» yeegii xaafintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Erim. 9:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18"/>Goday nashshiza athaypp attin fana paas nashshiza athay nashinttooya.<verse eid="2CO 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosarannee worddo hawaaritayira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1"/>Ta xiqqa bozetitha yi garzhodana ta amotiza; hayyana danda7oytta. <verse eid="2CO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2"/>Xoossay yinttis qoppeezay garkk, taakka yinttis qoppiza. Taanii yinttan fana naageez wudirtto pettii paanthay ma7isizay garkk, Kiristtoosas inggodayis oyccii gaddeeza.<verse eid="2CO 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3"/>Zini shooshii fa genayir Hiwanno balitheezay garkk o eree yi wozinay iitii Kiristtoosas yez yi luuletithannee geeshshetitha yi ashshodeshsha gi ta hirigiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-5">Medhe. 3:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4"/>Pettii as yi7ii, nuunii yinttis markkatteez Yesuusapp hara Yesuusa yinttis markkatiko, woy yi ekkeez Ayyaanayippennee Wonggilaypp hara ayyanannee Wonggile yinttis odiko, yi si77i gi ekkiza.<verse eid="2CO 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5"/>Zini taanii unttii fana «Nu Damma hawaarita» gizitaypp ta tana xiqqiza gi qoppaamii. <verse eid="2CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6"/>Taanii oda eroowa as maaqqikokka, eratithii taas yeza. Yeya ta yinttis gaame oger beezeeza.<verse eid="2CO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7"/>Taanii miishe oyccekka Xooss Wonggile yinttis cere odeezannee yinttan dhoqq udii tana toochcheezay taas nagara garkk payidinttodeshsha? <verse eid="2CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8"/>Taanii yinttan maaddodayis hara woosa keethitaypp miishe bonqq ekkeeza. <verse eid="2CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9"/>Ta yinttar yez wode tana metinkka yinttipp pettii asikka ta waaythekkaya. Maqadonapp ye7eez ishitay tana koshshiza baz ubbayid maaddeeza. Yhayino hellodayis ta yinttis toofo maaqqekkaya tiinaskka toofo maaqqaamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:15-18">Filp. 4:15-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10"/>Kiristtoosa tumatithay taal yezin, ta ceeqa Akkaya biitta tana oonkka kayenna. <verse eid="2CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11"/>Ta yhaya abis ginee? Yinttan dosowa gishosone? Taanii yinttan dosizana Xooss eriza.<verse eid="2CO 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12"/>Yhankko hawaaritay «Nuukka u garkk oothoda» yeegii ceeqqiza u ceeqayis oge dhabisodayis yhatti ta oothizana tiinaskka udoda. <verse eid="2CO 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13"/>Yhay garkk asitay Kiristtoosa hawaare aazodayis fana laammiza worddo hawaaritannee doosha oosanchchita. <verse eid="2CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14"/>Yeyi malabaz baaya; abis giiko, Xalahe poo7o kiitanchcho aazodayis fana laammiza. <verse eid="2CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15"/>Yeyi gishos, Xalahe oosanchchitay xillotith oosanchchita aazodayis fana laammiko yeyi dammabaz baaya. Unttii wurssithal fa oosay garkk ekkoda.<verse eid="2CO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosana helleez meto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16"/>Oonkka tana boozo gi qoppaamay garkk mahikka odiza. Ta yinttis boozo aazikokka ta laapar ceeqinttoday garkk tana boozo udii ekkoytta. <verse eid="2CO 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17"/>Taanii yhay garkk ceeqinttii odinttay, Goday koyiz garkk baazin bozetithar odiza. <verse eid="2CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18"/>Gaame asay yha sa7abazar ceeqinttiza gishos taakka ceeqinttoda. <verse eid="2CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19"/>Yi wozinaama maaqqeez gishos boozo asibaz ufayisar danda7iza. <verse eid="2CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20"/>Oonkka yinttan aylle udiko woy yinttan bonqqiko woy paas maadinttodayis yinttiko shiiqiko woy yinttal afa utirttiko woy yinttan baqqiko yi danda7iza. <verse eid="2CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21"/>Nuunii yeya oothodayis gaame daabura maaqqeezana yeellatitar ta odiza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Zini oonkka miinggii ceeqqinttiko, taakka miinggii ceeqqinttoda. Taanii yeya boozo as garkk odinttiza. <verse eid="2CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22"/>Unttii Ibraawe? Taakka Ibraawe. Unttii Isreele? Taakka Isreele. Unttii Afraame sheesho? Taakka Afraame sheeshii. <verse eid="2CO 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23"/>Unttii Kiristtoosa oosanachcho? Taanii eeya as garkk odiza, unttapp aadhiz Kiristtoosa oosanchcho. Taanii oosor gaame daabureeza; unddenna wode acintteeza; garafintteeza; gaame wode yhayiqos heleeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Haw. O. 16:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24"/>Ayihuditay tana hasttamannee uddufun ichchin toke garafeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:3">Nam7i. 25:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25"/>Hayidzii toke gufer shocintteeza; pettii toke shuchchar shocintteeza; markkabe hayidzii toke meqqeeza; abba gancce pettii qamma kunithi aqi peezheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:22">Haw. O. 16:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:19">14:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26"/>Taanii gaame oge daaburar yedhdheeza. Kixa haath di7opennee pannopp waaye tana helleeza. Ayihuditayinnee Ayihude maaqqekka asay taal afa meto heltheeza. Katama, liizho, abba, tana yashsheeza; ammaniza aaziza asitay tana waayiseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Haw. O. 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:15">14:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27"/>Taanii oosor daaburezannee caweeza, gaame toke gentta dhabeeza, nayintteeza, saamintteeza, gaame toke xoomeeza, meegintteeza, kalloteeza.<verse eid="2CO 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28"/>Hara baz ubba payidamixikokka ubba wode tana woosa keethitay bagga qofisiza. <verse eid="2CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29"/>Pettii as daaburodar ezar ta daaburekkazay ayide? Pettii as nagarara dhubinttin ta ayide kaccekka ashsheenee?<verse eid="2CO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30"/>Ta ceeqinttodayis beeziza baz maaqqiko taanii daabura maaqqeezana erisizabazar ceeqinttoda. <verse eid="2CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31"/>Medhinas bonchchintteez Xoossay, nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa Ada, ta worddotoozana eriza. <verse eid="2CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32"/>Damasqqo katamayid Aretaasa giz kaataypp oommor haarizay tana aythodayis kezii Damasqqo katama penga naagiseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23-25">Haw. O. 9:23-25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33"/>Zini asay tana daachcho gancce olii, katama gase maskkooter wodhisin taanii e kushepp ateeza.<verse eid="2CO 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa qonccith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1"/>Ceeqintto abikka adooya. Zini ceeqinttay koshshiko, Godaypp ekkeez qonccithar ceeqqoda. <verse eid="2CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2"/>Taphpho oydd laythapp tiina, Kiristtoosa ammaniza pettii athay hayidzantho salo yhanigeezana ta eriza. Ye athay yhanigeezay ashor maaqqo woy ashor maaqqaaminxo ta erooya; Xooss eriza. <verse eid="2CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3"/>Ye athay hayidzintha salo ekintteezana eriza. Zini E ekintteezay ashor woy ashor maaqqaaminxo ta erooya; Xooss eriza. <verse eid="2CO 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4"/>Ye athay gennette ekinttii asii qonccisodayisnnee as ododayis danda7oowa baz si7eeza. <verse eid="2CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5"/>Taanii ye atha bazay gishos ceeqinttoda, zin taanii ta daaburaypp attin taal ceeqinttizabaz baaya. <verse eid="2CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6"/>Taanii turo odinttiz gishos ceeqinttodayis koykokka ta boozo baaya. Zini as ta oothiza bi7izayipennee si7izaypp aathii qoppaam garkk gi ceeqinttopp naaginttoda.<verse eid="2CO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7"/>Taas qoncceez damma qonccithar ta uttirttaamay garkk tana un7isiza ta ashayid caddiza Xalahe kiitanchchay taas inggitteeza. <verse eid="2CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8"/>Yha un7ithiza baz taapp haasodaygarkk taanii Goda hayidzii toke woosseeza. <verse eid="2CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9"/>Zini Goday, «Ta wolqqay ne daaburar benttiz gishos ta aadho keehatithay nees maaqqoda» yeegeeza. Kiristtoosa wolqqay taal benttoday garkk ta daaburar ufayttittar ceeqinttiza. <verse eid="2CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10"/>Taanii Kiristtoosa gishos daaburiza wode cazhinttiza wode waayiza wode bayi7inttiz wode metinttiza wode ta daaburssayir ufayttiza. Abis giiko, ta daaburiza wode ye wode miinggiza.<verse eid="2CO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa asayis qopo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11"/>Taanii boozo as garkk odeeza. Yey garkk ta ceeqnttoday garkk ootheezay yinttan. Ta, ta ubbas erinttoowa as maaqqikokka, «Dammo hawaaritaypp» abarakka laafooya. Yeya taas markkattodayis beezizay yinttana. <verse eid="2CO 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12"/>Ta yi gancce yezar danda7ar ootheez malabazitannee malliitay wolqqa oosttay ta tuma hawaare maaqqeezana beeziza. <verse eid="2CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13"/>Ta yinttis toofo maaqqekka atteezaypp attin yhankko woosa keethitaypp yi abar xiqqeenee? Yeyi bala maaqqiko tana maaroytta.<verse eid="2CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14"/>Taanii yinttiko yhanigodayis giiginttodar yhayi taas hayidzintho. Ta yinttanapp attin yinttis yeza baz koyowa gishos yinttan waayisodayis koyooya. Yeleezitay fa na7itayis shalo minjjinepp attin na7itay fana yeleezitayis shalo minjjooya. <verse eid="2CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15"/>Ta yi gishos taas yezabazinnee tana aathii inggikokka tana ufayssiza. Yeezin, taanii yinttan yhay garkk wolqqama siiqo siiqiza wode yi tana laapar siiqinenee?<verse eid="2CO 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16"/>Hanopp attin, ta yinttis toofo maaqqekkaya; waayisekkaya; zin yinttan doosharannee gener aykkeezibaz yinttis aazo attaamii. <verse eid="2CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17"/>Hara attozin, ta yinttiko kiitteez asitaypp yinttan dooshsheez as yenee? <verse eid="2CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18"/>Tito yinttiko yhanigoday garkk ta woosseeza; ma ammaniza ishakka ezar dakkeeza. Yeezin, Tito yinttan dooshshinee? Nuunii nu oosa pettii ayyanar oothekkasa? Ma nu hanayirakka petto baasannee?<verse eid="2CO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19"/>Nu ubba wode yi tiina nuna xillisodayis mootinttizabaz yinttis aazinee? Nu Kiristtoosar yezii Xooss tiina yhanno hellodayis odiza. Nu siiqo ishuntho, nu yha ubba odizay yinttan dichchodayisii. <verse eid="2CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20"/>Ta yinttiko yhanigiza wode oonii eree yi ta koyizay garkk hanekka, ma taakka yi koyizay garkk hanekkazar woli hello attaamii gi yashittiza. Ma oonii eree yi gancce palama, qinaate, kachchii, fana qadhe, hawoza as sunth iiso utirannee cabboto yesse attaamii gi ta yashittiza. <verse eid="2CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21"/>Taanii nam7intho yinttiko yhanigodar Xoossay yi tiina tana kawushshoda gi ta yashittiza. Binii nagara oothii fa ootheez tunatithaypp, laggita qayixe yeellathiza oosopp maaqqekka asita bi7ii azano ashshaamii gi hirigiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23-25">Haw. O. 9:23-25</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith zorennee sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1"/>Ta yinttiko ye7odar yhayi hayidzintho. Aba mootokka nam7ar woy hayidzii markkar miinggiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Nam7i. 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2"/>Taanii nam7intho yinttan helleez wode yi gancce tiina nagara ootheez athannee yhankkita ubba seero ashshaamii gi odayil gujeeza. Yhatti ta haakkii yezikoka maaqqii yinttiko yhanigeez wode ooskka qadhinttaamii.<verse eid="2CO 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3"/>Taar yezi odizay Kiristtoosa maaqqeezana yi erodayis koyiza. E yinttar odittar wolqqamapp attin yi gancce daabura baaya. <verse eid="2CO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4"/>Kiristtoosa mazqalel afa daaburar sotintteeza, zin Xooss wolqqar de7o yeziza. Nuukka ezar daaburita maaqqeeza. Zini yinttar oothiza oosayir Xooss wolqqar de7o yezoda.<verse eid="2CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5"/>Ammanor miinggii yezako yinttan yinttis paacii bo7oytta. Paacer yi pokkekka attiko, Kiristtoosa yinttar yezana yi eriza. Zini Kiristtoosa yinttar yezaam ixxiko yi pokkoda. <verse eid="2CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6"/>Nuunii paacer pokkowazana yi eriza gi ammaniza.<verse eid="2CO 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7"/>Yi iita baz oothaamay garkk nuunii Xooss woossiza. Nuunii mino maaqqeezana asay be7adaygarkk baazin nuunii mino maaqqaam ixxikokka, yi lo77o baz udod garkk nuunii woossiza. <verse eid="2CO 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8"/>Nuunii tumas oothinepp attin tumar eqinttizabaz abikka oothaamii. <verse eid="2CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9"/>Nu daaburodar yi ma minggiko nuna ufayssiza. Yi bore baazita maaqqoday garkk nu yinttis Xooss woossiza.<verse eid="2CO 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10"/>Taanii yinttipp haakko yezar xaafeezay yey gishos. Taanii yinttiko yhanigeez gallas Goday taas inggeez mawutel ankkitii yinttal afa godatodayis koyooya. Goday taas mawute inggeezay, yinttan miinthodayisapp attin laalodayis baaya.<verse eid="2CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11"/>Yhaypp gede ta ishuntho, saro yezoytta. Bore bayth yezoytta; ta zora si7oytta. Pettii wozina maaqqii yezoytta; sarotithar yezoytta. Siiqonnee saro inggiz Xoossay yinttar maaqqoda.<verse eid="2CO 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12"/>Geeshsha yeera yeerinttor, woli sarothoytta. <verse eid="2CO 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13"/>Xoossa asay ubbay yinttan saro saro yeegiza.<verse eid="2CO 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14"/>Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatithay, Xooss siiqqay, Geeshsha Ayyana pettipettithay yi ubbayir maaqqo.<verse eid="2CO 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13"/>
</usx>
